%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SuperAdmin as Super Admin
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as PlatformAdminService
    participant Records as MasterDataRepository
    participant Dep as AuditSink
    SuperAdmin->>UI: Select platform data or a promotion and submit changes
    UI->>Service: Submit platform data and promotion management request
    Service->>Records: Validate completeness, uniqueness, and applicable rules
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate role Super Admin dan data induk valid
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: recordMasterDataChange(admin, change)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Save the approved change and audit record
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Apply the platform data or promotion change
        UI-->>SuperAdmin: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Return invalid fields for correction
        UI-->>SuperAdmin: Display the reason and required action
    end
